id size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-butter"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-45" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Most brand identities take four to six weeks and most websites six to ten. Monthly plans start within a week of signing. You&#x27;ll get a week-by-week timeline before any work begins.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:70ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Can I cancel a monthly plan?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-1" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Yes, anytime, with 30 days&#x27; notice. There are no long contracts and no cancellation fees. We&#x27;d rather keep you because the work is good.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:140ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Do you only work with big brands?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-2" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Not at all. Most of our clients are small and growing businesses, from first-time founders to teams of a few hundred. If you care about doing it properly, we&#x27;re in.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:210ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">What do you need from me to get started?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-3" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">A 30-minute call, your goals and anything you already have, like a logo, photos or an old website. We handle the rest and tell you exactly when we need your input.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:280ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Do I own the final work?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-4" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Yes. Once the final invoice is paid, every final file and all the rights to it are yours to keep, change and use however you like.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:350ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-5" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-5" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Can you work with my existing brand or website?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-5" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Absolutely. We often refresh or extend what&#x27;s already working rather than starting over, and we&#x27;ll be honest about what to keep and what to change.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:420ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-6" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-6" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Where are you based?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-6" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Our studio is in Portland, Oregon, but most of our work happens remotely with clients all over the world. Time zones have never stopped a good project.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></section><section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title" class="relative bg-cream py-24 sm:py-32"><div aria-hidden="true" class="scallop-wave pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 z-10 scallop-up bottom-[calc(100%-1px)] text-cream"></div><div class